  "description": "Reborn as a sword, I lived for several hundred years, spending my entire existence looking after everyone. Then, out of nowhere, I took over the body of a fifteen-year-old uncouth first prince.\n\n*\"Do you have any idea how many I've raised?\"*\n\nThe great knight once called the Undefeated, the Dragon Slayer who brought down the Mad Dragon, the Mercenary King, and more... I raised every single one of them. The Magic Sword Gruhorn possessed the body of the uncouth first prince... And has begun to write a new legend.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
